                                        "entry_id": "be509b03-7f6a-3074-a8aa-56327b0de414",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To dress in breeches. (especially) To dress a boy in breeches or trousers for the first time (the breeching ceremony)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
