                                                "sense_id": "980181ea-2946-3300-abd6-47fdad698dac",
                                                "text": "[…] it occurred before I was breeched, and I was breeched at three years and a quarter old;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e729a29-dbc3-46e6-a1cf-656690462847",
                                                "sense_id": "980181ea-2946-3300-abd6-47fdad698dac",
                                                "text": "A great man […] anxious to know whether the blacksmith's youngest boy was breeched."
                                            }
